  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "This bright Destin escape is ready to host your group with plenty of space and style. Completely remodeled in 2022, Carmine features all-new furniture, floors, lighting, and more. Spend your days lounging near the lagoon-style community pool, soaking in the hot tub, or hanging on the balcony cooking on your private grill. When you're ready to explore the shores, a seasonal trolley will take you (along with the included wagon, chair, and toys) straight to Pompano St Beach Access! <br><br>Two private balconies — one on each level — look toward the pool and feature comfortable seating, while each of the six bedrooms features a TV. Many windows and glass doors let tons of natural light spill into the chic living room, dining area, and kitchen (complete with barstool seating and stainless steel appliances). You'll be near gorgeous parks, family-friendly activities, and convenient dining and shopping options. Carmine is waiting to show your group a Destin retreat like no other!<br><br>AvantStay provides a personalized hospitality experience to elevate your stay. With our Concierge Service, guests have access to our tech-enabled services like fridge stocking, private chefs, massages, transportation, special occasion celebrations, baby gear rentals, ski gear, beach gear, and more. For anything you need, we’re at your fingertips!<br><br>Located in Northwest Florida, Destin is dubbed the “world's luckiest fishing village.” This Emerald Coast city is known for its sparkling white beaches, numerous golf courses, and world-famous fishing. Nearby zipline courses, dolphin cruises, and amusement parks make it a perfect destination for families. Adults and large groups also come here for beach parties during the day and live music at night.<br><br>Local Attractions: Henderson Beach State Park, Destin Commons, Silversands Outlets, Crab Island, Fred Gannon Rocky Bayou State Park, Gulfarium Marine Adventure Park, Charter Offshore Fishing, Big Kahuna’s Water and Adventure Park, Crackings, Louisiana Lagniappe, Jackacuda’s Seafood + Sushi<br><br>Home Truths:<br>- Please note that active commercial and residential construction is currently underway in the city of Destin.<br>- Unfortunately, pets are not allowed at this home. If undisclosed pets are brought into the home without AvantStay's approval there is a fine of $500 per pet.<br>- The HOA does not allow golf carts at this home.<br><br>Parking Details:<br>2 cars can park onsite.<br><br>---<br><br>The room configuration is as follows:<br>Primary Bedroom / King bed w/ ensuite<br>Bedroom 2 / Queen bed<br>Bedroom 3 / Bunk bed<br>Bedroom 4 / King bed<br>Bedroom 5 / Queen bed<br>Bedroom 6 / Two twin beds<br><br>​​​​​​​---<br><br>This is a smoke-free property. Violation of the no-smoking policy will result in forfeiture of the security deposit, a $300 smoking fee, and liability for any fire or property damage costs.<br><br>As part of our commitment to being good neighbors, occupancy limits and quiet hours (9pm-8am) are strictly enforced. No speakers or sound systems will be provided for use in our properties. Violation of any noise ordinances will be subject to fines that can reach up to $10,000 per violation. <br><br>Events or parties are not allowed without prior written approval and an additional fee. Any unauthorized parties or events will be shut down and a fine will be assessed. Please inquire for more information about our event policies and fees. <br><br>There is nothing more important to us at AvantStay than the health, safety, and experience of our guests & staff. We've enhanced our cleaning and sanitation protocols and are taking extra care to disinfect all surfaces between reservations with hospital-grade disinfecting solutions.<br><br>As a reminder, we do work with 3rd party vendors to maintain the property, and although we adhere to the strictest CDC guidelines and advise all contractors to wear PPE equipment, we can not always enforce. We strongly advise guests to please deny access if any vendors fail to meet and adhere to these standards.<br><br>IDs will be requested for verification after booking. All bookings over 30 days require a security deposit.<br><br>We report and prosecute all Credit Card Fraud.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
